gorgeous nails you love without the $50+ price tag."}},"feature_KLpxBw":{"type":"feature","settings":{"title":"Skip the Extra Spend","description":"No tips, no gas, no sitter. Just beautiful nails anytime, anywhere."}},"feature_kxUwRC":{"type":"feature","settings":{"title":"Stretch Your Beauty Budget","description":"Get multiple months for what you'd spend on just one at the salon"}}},"block_order":["feature_nHULiL","feature_KLpxBw","feature_kxUwRC"],"name":"New Image Text","settings":{"full_width":false,"sec_id":"","background_color":"#fff5ff","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/sawxd_1.png","image_position":"left","heading":"Why Glam Gel Nails are","heading_accent":"Perfect for You","margin_top":0,"margin_bottom":0,"padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":0,"margin_top_m":0,"margin_bottom_m":0,"padding_top_m":0,"padding_bottom_m":0}},"founder_story_6BQKdy":{"type":"founder-story","blocks":{"paragraph_c8fYJi":{"type":"paragraph","settings":{"text":"Like millions of women, I was spending $200+ monthly on salon visits while juggling kids, work, and life. The breaking point came when I realized my nail budget was bigger than my grocery budget."}},"paragraph_Qiait8":{"type":"paragraph","settings":{"text":"That's when I discovered the secret: professional-grade gel strips that deliver salon results at home. No more paying top dollar for rushed appointments, inconvenient scheduling, or chipped polish days later."}},"paragraph_YJFAhg":{"type":"paragraph","settings":{"text":"Today, over 100,000 women have joined the GGN revolution, saving thousands while looking fabulous."}},"author_ENeBak":{"type":"author","settings":{"author_text":"- Rachel, Founder of GGN"}}},"block_order":["paragraph_c8fYJi","paragraph_Qiait8","paragraph_YJFAhg","author_ENeBak"],"name":"Founder Story","settings":{"full_width":false,"sec_id":"","background_color":"#fff5ff","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Product_Image_17.png","image_position":"right","heading":"From Frustrated Mom to","heading_accent":"Beauty Innovator","button_text":"Shop Gel Nail Strips","button_url":"shopify:\/\/collections\/all","margin_top":0,"margin_bottom":0,"padding_top":80,"padding_bottom":80,"margin_top_m":0,"margin_bottom_m":0,"padding_top_m":48,"padding_bottom_m":48}},"maze_product_faq_j68wK7":{"type":"maze-product-faq","blocks":{"faq_7w6bLk":{"type":"faq","settings":{"title":"How long will my manicure last?","content":"<p>Your mani should last 10-14 days. Consider using a topcoat to extend its longevity!  <\/p>"}},"faq_Gyaq8c":{"type":"faq","settings":{"title":"How often do you launch new designs?","content":"<p>We are constantly working on new designs. Have a suggestion? Feel free to share it with us!<\/p>"}},"faq_RMAe3q":{"type":"faq","settings":{"title":"Can I reuse my gel nail strips?","content":"<p>Unfortunately, once applied to your nails, the gel nail strips cannot be reused.<\/p>"}},"faq_wFjeUa":{"type":"faq","settings":{"title":"How long should I cure?","content":"<p>Only 60 seconds. If you don’t have a UV lamp, you can order your Glam Gel Nail UV Lamp here.<\/p>"}},"faq_epGTpD":{"type":"faq","settings":{"title":"When will you ship my order?","content":"<p>Your order will typically ship within 1-2 business days.<\/p>"}},"faq_8Fbt7k":{"type":"faq","settings":{"title":"Can I cancel or modify my order?","content":"<p>Unfortunately we cannot modify or cancel an order after it has been placed. Our team is committed to swiftly processing and delivering your orders, and any alterations would hinder this efficiency.<\/p>"}},"faq_JVt78R":{"type":"faq","settings":{"title":"How do I remove them?","content":"<p>Apply oil to the edges and cuticles of your nails. Wedge the wooden stick provided in our nail kit under the nail wrap and gently lift up. <\/p>"}},"faq_P4ctfk":{"type":"faq","settings":{"title":"Do you offer international shipping?","content":"<p>Currently we only offer shipping within the United States.<\/p>"}},"faq_grPNJ7":{"type":"faq","settings":{"title":"Can I use oils or lotions on my hands while wearing gel nail strips?","content":"<p>Lotions are okay, but for longevity we recommend avoiding oils and oil-based lotions on your hands while wearing Glam Gel Nails. Oils can break down the adhesive, which may cause your nails to lift or separate from your natural nails. <\/p>"}}},"block_order":["faq_7w6bLk","faq_Gyaq8c","faq_RMAe3q","faq_wFjeUa","faq_epGTpD","faq_8Fbt7k","faq_JVt78R","faq_P4ctfk","faq_grPNJ7"],"settings":{"title":"Frequently Asked Questions","faq_img":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/WhatsApp_Image_2025-04-08_at_13.34.04-removebg-preview.png","bg-color":"#fff5ff","margin_top":0,"margin_bottom":0,"padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":0,"margin_top_mobile":0,"margin_bottom_mobile":0,"padding_top_mobile":0,"padding_bottom_mobile":0}},"testimonial_slider_94LErb":{"type":"testimonial-slider","blocks":{"testimonial_ACYQUL":{"type":"testimonial","settings":{"content":"So I put these semi-cured gel nails through the wringer-dishes, dirt, you name it. And guess what? They're still kicking! Seriously impressed with how well they've held up.","author":"Amber J."}},"testimonial_4i8NTP":{"type":"testimonial","settings":{"content":"I was a bit skeptical at first, but they were easier to apply than I thought. Definitely won't be going back to the nail salon!","author":"Samantha M."}},"testimonial_g4GPUK":{"type":"testimonial","settings":{"content":"As someone who loves switching up their nail color frequently, these have been a dream come true. Plus, the removal process is a breeze! Highly recommend!","author":"Penelope J."}},"testimonial_rqyznd":{"type":"testimonial","settings":{"content":"Out of all the at-home semi cured gel nails I've tested, this one takes the cake. They are cute, flexible, and fit perfectly to my nails. I'd rate it 10\/10!","author":"Josie R."}}},"block_order":["testimonial_ACYQUL","testimonial_4i8NTP","testimonial_g4GPUK","testimonial_rqyznd"],"name":"Testimonials Slider","settings":{"full_width":false,"background_color":"#fff5ff","